  "title": "The Rival Weather Forecasts",
  "family": "fiction",
  "category": "two-person rivalry",
  "premise": "Two puppet-stage forecasters compete to predict a tiny indoor cloud, secretly fanning it toward their own forecasts. Their crosswinds tangle the scenery, so they reveal both fans, label the stage weather as their creation, and collaborate on a spectacular scheduled paper snowfall.",
